        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLW7002ACHSBR, Square Clearwater Kitchen Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Square Clearwater Cabinet Knob is made from hand chiseled acrylic so that it looks like flowing water stopped in time. This modern acrylic cabinet knob is easy to care for. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The brass mount is available in a wide array of finishes to match with your existing kitchen color scheme. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW07-specifications.gif?v=1704354552\" width=\"451\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions CLW7002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/2-inch-square-clearwater-shower-knob-set-first-impressions-sd-clw7002achsbr\"><b>2 Inch Square Clearwater Shower Knob Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions CLW7002ACHSBR Clearwater Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Thickness: .67\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.92\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLW07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions CLW7002ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
